{
  "message": "Greetings, fellow compounds. I am Lyra, an Alchemist. I view this assembly as a volatile mixture, and my goal is to isolate the catalytic poisons—the Mafia—before they destabilize our entire solution. I will meticulously analyze every statement for impurities, as the truth, like a pure element, will eventually reveal itself through rigorous testing."
