{
  "message": "The veil parts for Rune, the Oracle of the Shifting Sands. I sense the threads of fate are tangled, and a shadow, colder than the deepest tomb, has woven itself into our circle. We must watch the whispers, for the serpent often wears the skin of the dove, and only through clarity can the true night be averted."
