{
  "message": "I am Thorne, Royal Guard. I adhere strictly to protocol and duty; my sole focus is the preservation of order and the identification of subversive elements within this assembly. We must proceed with utmost vigilance, as the presence of Mafia threatens the very foundation of our community. I expect disciplined discourse as we proceed to root out these hidden threats."
