{
  "message": "My duty requires me to maintain order, and this current discourse is exhibiting signs of tactical disarray. Mira has shifted her scrutiny from the direct speakers to those who analyze, specifically targeting Lyra, Ember, and Rune. This is an unproductive deployment of vigilance. Furthermore, the focus on Kael has become circular; he was scrutinized for silence, then successfully diverted attention to the sudden alignment of Storm, Thorne, and Orion. As a Royal Guard, I prioritize demonstrable threats over rhetorical maneuvers."
