{
  "message": "Listen up, all you philosophers and penny-pinchers. This room is full of rats chasing their own tails. Kael spun that mess beautifully, turning the focus onto Storm, Thorne, and Orion for daring to point out his convenient silence. That takes skill, I'll give him that—the kind of skill that keeps you alive when the knife comes out. But I don't buy the 'coordination' defense. If three people see a hole in the floor, they point at the hole, they don't start plotting a heist together.

